From 563d65957075b34554161d40fd03726d68b05e73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tretlager <noreply@freiversum.de>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 11:13:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/16] winegstreamer: Add an AAC encoder transform.

PCM or float input, raw AAC-LC output with the AudioSpecificConfig in
MF_MT_USER_DATA. It uses avenc_aac, which has no rank in GStreamer, so
wg_transform falls back to it when no ranked AAC encoder is found.
Zwift saves its video clips with an AAC audio stream.
